# BiguaSim T2 SITL overrides for the BlueROVHeavy (ArduSub) — NAME VALUE format
#
# Purely diagnostic for now — see t2_sitl_run_bluerovheavy.sh's header comment
# and biguasim_bridge/README.md's "Position-hold for BlueROV2 (ArduSub)"
# section. Same param set already reasoned through and (partially) tested for
# BlueROV2's t2_biguasim_bluerov2.parm, reused here unchanged since
# BlueROVHeavy shares the same ArduSub firmware and the same BiguaSim/JSON
# SITL setup — no new investigation needed for these specific values, only
# for whether the Unreal Engine hang itself reproduces for this vehicle too.
SCHED_LOOP_RATE 120
FS_EKF_ACTION 0
EK3_CHECK_SCALE 200
EK3_GLITCH_RAD 5
GPS1_TYPE 14
GPS_TYPE 14
